 LED delivers steady light for trails, tent setup, roadside fixes and dim workspaces. The", "【1000mAh High-Capacity Battery with 2 Charging Cables】Powered by a 1000mAh high-capacity battery built for rugged outdoor expeditions. With convenient magnetic fast charging, the watch fully charges i", "【Bluetooth 5.2 Calls & Built-in Voice Assistant】Equipped with high-sensitivity mic and HD speaker, this rugged men’s watch uses Bluetooth 5.2 for stable, lag-free calls even in forests and mountains. ", "【100+ Sport Modes & IP68 Waterproof】With over 100 sport modes, this watch keeps up with your active lifestyle whether you’re trail hiking, mountain climbing, gym training or doing daily workouts. It l"]}, "B0BCXF3T1W": {"rating": 3.9, "reviews": 133, "bullets": ["Battery/playtime: 22+ hours of wireless Bluetooth 5 playtime keeps kids gaming all day, plus an included AUX cord for wired backup when the battery runs low.", "Volume safety: Built-in volume limiting at 85dB protects young ears during long gaming sessions, so parents can feel confident letting kids play for hours.", "Comfort: Designed for ages 6 and up with cushioned ear cups and adjustable headband, providing all-day comfort support sized right for younger gamers.", "Bluetooth with 60ms super-low latency: aptX low-latency Bluetooth 5 delivers near-instant audio sync for mobile gameplay, plus AUX compatibility for PS, Xbox, Switch, and PC/Mac consoles.", "Retractable boom mic and warranty: Built-in retractable boom mic lets kids chat with teammates and tucks away for solo play; backed by JLab's 2-year limited warranty."]}, "B06XCKGLTP": {"rating": 4.5, "reviews": 34644, "bullets": ["[Convenient Setup] Plug and play recording USB microphone for PC, with 5.9-Foot USB cable included for computer PC laptop, is connected directly to USB-A port for recording music, computer singing or ", "[Durable Metal Design] Solid sturdy metal construction design, the computer microphone for Zoom meetings with stable tripod stand is c